-- pricing.talk: the other half of the orders-pricing sketch case (ADR 0018).
-- Grants come from case.toml: prices: lookup (suspending, answered by a
-- `> answer` line in case.trace)

on quote sku, qty
  ask prices to lookup sku
  put it into unit
  wait 1 s                 -- deadline on the case's virtual Clock
  return unit * qty
end quote
